#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/1-robot_descriptions.md:51
#: d6de91c9eb78407aa7e374987a824c77
msgid ""
"FiveAges URDF packages are gitlinks under `humanoid/FiveAges/` in "
"[`.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/main/.gitmodules). They are **not** in the "
"README brand tables and are **not** a separate `robot-descriptions-"
"fiveages` umbrella. **Public:** W1, W2, S2, `fa-w2-components`. **Still "
"private:** **W2R**, **S2R** (not open yet), Gen3. Paths and remotes: "
"[FiveAges robot descriptions](4-fiveages_umbrella.md)."
msgstr ""
"FiveAges 的 URDF 包是"
"[`.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_descriptions/blob/main/.gitmodules)"
"里 `humanoid/FiveAges/`下的 gitlink。它们**不在** README 品牌表中，也**不是**独立的"
"`robot-descriptions-fiveages`伞形仓。**公开：**"
"W1、W2、S2、`fa-w2-components`。**仍为私有：**"
"**W2R**、**S2R**（尚未开放）、Gen3。路径与远端：[FiveAges 机器人描述](4-fiveages_umbrella.md)。"

